{"label": "Adults With Intellectual Disability, Historical Terminology",
"definition": "Behavior-analytic work on adults described with the outdated diagnostic term \"mentally retarded\". The topic is identified mainly by that terminology, and no recent titles sit at its center.",
"distinct_from_neighbours": "It concerns adults under the outdated label. A sibling topic covers children under that label, and the others use modern disability terms for challenging behavior or school instruction."}
